<td id="S4.T5.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t">80.9% (73.3–86.7)</td>
<td id="S4.T5.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t">86.4% (76.1–92.7)</td>
